    "body": "FWIW, I was reading some relevant code in Firefox and I think it is also following the current spec where removing meta doesn't change anything. And it is also doing the same as Chrome that it uses that last meta valid element, not tree order.\r\nThe reason for the current behavior is https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1653474\r\nSee also comment 4 there.\r\n\r\ncc @sefeng211 ",
